  "steps": [
    "Press tofu to remove excess moisture, then dice into cubes.",
    "Toss tofu with cornflour, a pinch of salt, and pepper until evenly coated.",
    "Whisk together tamari, rice wine vinegar, brown sugar, cornflour, water, minced ginger, and minced garlic to make the sauce.",
    "Heat a frypan over medium-high heat with cooking oil. Cook tofu until golden on all sides.",
    "Pour in the sauce and toss to coat. Cook for a few minutes until the sauce reduces and thickens.",
    "Serve tofu over steamed rice with boiled edamame, avocado, toasted sesame seeds, and sliced spring onion.",
    "Drizzle with vegan mayo if desired and serve hot."
  ],
  "tips": [
    "Use extra-firm tofu for the crispiest texture.",
    "If the sauce thickens too much, loosen with a splash of water.",
